text = "Check three things: (1) Is the ALGORITHM strong? (AES or 3-key Triple DES) (2) Is the MODE secure? (CBC with MAC, or GCM) (3) Is KEY MANAGEMENT proper? (HSM, vault, rotation — never hardcoded or plaintext)"
